      "background": "",
      "content": "There is no ∗∗∗∗ in this Net<br/>\nor detritus and it is <br/>\nnot useful when things shiver <br/>\nor disappear and there is<br/>\nno way to ask or reply. <br/>\nThis is not a record of <br/>\nan aerosol line of thought. <br/>\nIt is not a forgetful <br/>\npayload. And you tidied our<br/> \nmachinery by saying <br/>\n<em>it is <aa to=\"72,124\">eusocial</aa></em> but I <br/>\ndon’t want to know about how <br/> \nto absolve hungry termites<br/> \nin a middleware of blue<br/>\nexceptions. I want to be <br/>\nreddened and fed away from <br/>\nthe tasteless cellulose of <br/>\nknowing or whatever it’s<br/>\nmade up in. Maybe a cup.<br/>\nI want to remember the <br/>\nactually yes there always<br/>\nsentiment of waterless <br/>\nhunting in the world before <br/>\nit is swallowed by a <em>you</em><br/>\nsound and its young petrichor.",
